{
  "snp2.14:0.1": "",
  "snp2.14:0.2": "",
  "snp2.14:1.1": "Evam me sutaṃ: ",
  "snp2.14:1.2": "Ekaṃ samayaṃ Bhagavā Sāvatthiyaṃ viharati Jetavane Anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme. ",
  "snp2.14:1.3": "Atha kho Dhammiko upāsako pañcahi upāsakasatehi saddhiṃ yena Bhagavā ten' upasaṃkami, upasaṃkamitvā Bhagavantaṃ abhivādetvā ekamantaṃ nisīdi. Ekamantaṃ nisinno kho Dhammiko upāsako Bhagavantaṃ gāthāhi ajjhabhāsi: 376. ",
  "snp2.14:2.1": "\"Pucchāmi taṃ Gotama bhūripañña: ",
  "snp2.14:2.2": "kathaṃkaro sāvako sādhu hoti, ",
  "snp2.14:2.3": "yo vā agārā anagāram eti ",
  "snp2.14:2.4": "agārino vā pan' upāsakāse. 377. Tuvaṃ ",
  "snp2.14:3.1": "hi lokassa sadevakassa ",
  "snp2.14:3.2": "gatiṃ pajānāsi parāyanañ ca: ",
  "snp2.14:3.3": "na t' atthi tulyo nipuṇatthadassī, ",
  "snp2.14:3.4": "tuvaṃ hi Buddhaṃ pavaraṃ vadanti. 378. ",
  "snp2.14:4.1": "Sabbaṃ tuvaṃ ñāṇam avecca dhammaṃ ",
  "snp2.14:4.2": "pakāsesi satte anukampamāno, ",
  "snp2.14:4.3": "vivattacchaddāsi samantacakkhu, ",
  "snp2.14:4.4": "virocasi vimalo sabbaloke. 379. ",
  "snp2.14:5.1": "Āgacchi te santike nāgarājā ",
  "snp2.14:5.2": "Erāvaṇo nāma ‘Jino' ti sutvā, ",
  "snp2.14:5.3": "so pi tayā mantayitvājjhagamā ",
  "snp2.14:5.4": "‘sādhū' ti sutvāna patītarūpo. 380. ",
  "snp2.14:6.1": "Rājā pi taṃ Vessavaṇo Kuvero ",
  "snp2.14:6.2": "",
  "snp2.14:6.3": "tassāpi tvaṃ pucchito brūsi dhīra, ",
  "snp2.14:6.4": "so cāpi sutvāna patītarūpo. 381. ",
  "snp2.14:7.1": "Ye kec' ime titthiyā vādasīlā, ",
  "snp2.14:7.2": "ājīvikā vā yadi vā nigaṇṭhā, ",
  "snp2.14:7.3": "paññāya taṃ nātitaranti sabbe ",
  "snp2.14:7.4": "ṭhito vajantaṃ viya sīghagāmiṃ. 382. ",
  "snp2.14:8.1": "Ye kec' ime brāhmaṇā vādasīlā ",
  "snp2.14:8.2": "vuddhā cāpi brāhmaṇā santi keci, ",
  "snp2.14:8.3": "sabbe tayi atthabaddhā bhavanti, ",
  "snp2.14:8.4": "ye vā pi c' aññe vādino maññamānā. 383. ",
  "snp2.14:9.1": "Ayaṃ hi dhammo nipuṇo sukho ca, ",
  "snp2.14:9.2": "yo 'yaṃ tayā Bhagavā suppavutto, ",
  "snp2.14:9.3": "tam eva sabbe sussūsamānā, ",
  "snp2.14:9.4": "tvan no vada pucchito baddhaseṭṭha. 384. Sabbe ",
  "snp2.14:10.1": "c' ime bhikkhavo sannisinnā ",
  "snp2.14:10.2": "upāsakā cāpi tath' eva sotuṃ ",
  "snp2.14:10.3": "saṇantu dhammaṃ vimalenānubuddhaṃ ",
  "snp2.14:10.4": "subhāsitaṃ Vāsavasseva devā\". 385. ",
  "snp2.14:11.1": "\"Suṇātha me bhikkhavo, sāvayāmi vo ",
  "snp2.14:11.2": "dhammaṃ dhutaṃ, tañ ca dharātha sabbe,| ",
  "snp2.14:11.3": "iriyāpathaṃ pabbajitānulomikaṃ ",
  "snp2.14:11.4": "sevetha naṃ atthadassī mutīmā. 386. ",
  "snp2.14:12.1": "Na ve vikāle vicareyya bhikkhu, ",
  "snp2.14:12.2": "gāmañ ca piṇḍāya careyya kāle, ",
  "snp2.14:12.3": "akālacāriṃ hi sajanti saṅgā, ",
  "snp2.14:12.4": "tasmā vikāle na caranti buddhā. 387. ",
  "snp2.14:13.1": "Rūpā ca saddā ca rasā ca gandhā ",
  "snp2.14:13.2": "phassā ca ye sammadayanti satte, ",
  "snp2.14:13.3": "etesu dhammesu vineyya chandaṃ ",
  "snp2.14:13.4": "kālena so pavise pātarāsaṃ. 388. ",
  "snp2.14:14.1": "Piṇḍañ ca bhikkhu samayena laddhā ",
  "snp2.14:14.2": "eko paṭikkamma raho nisīde, ",
  "snp2.14:14.3": "ajjhattacinti na mano bahiddhā ",
  "snp2.14:14.4": "nicchāraye saṅgahītattabhāvo. 389. ",
  "snp2.14:15.1": "Sace pi so sallape sāvakena ",
  "snp2.14:15.2": "aññena vā kenaci bhikkhunā vā, ",
  "snp2.14:15.3": "dhammaṃ paṇītaṃ tam udāhareyya ",
  "snp2.14:15.4": "na pesuṇaṃ no pi parūpavādaṃ. 390. ",
  "snp2.14:16.1": "Vādaṃ hi eke paṭiseniyanti, ",
  "snp2.14:16.2": "na te pasaṃsāma parittapaññe, ",
  "snp2.14:16.3": "tato tato ne pasajanti saṅgā, ",
  "snp2.14:16.4": "cittaṃ hi te tattha gamenti dūre. 391. ",
  "snp2.14:17.1": "Piṇḍaṃ vihāraṃ sayanāsanañ ca ",
  "snp2.14:17.2": "āpañ ca saṃghāṭirajūpavāhanaṃ ",
  "snp2.14:17.3": "sutvāna dhammaṃ Sugatena desitaṃ ",
  "snp2.14:17.4": "saṃkhāya seve varapaññasāvako. 392. ",
  "snp2.14:18.1": "Tasmā hi piṇḍe sayanāsane ca ",
  "snp2.14:18.2": "āpe ca saṃghāṭirajūpavābane, --| ",
  "snp2.14:18.3": "etesu dhammesu anūpalitto ",
  "snp2.14:18.4": "bhikkhu yathā pokkhare vāribindu. 393. ",
  "snp2.14:19.1": "Gahaṭṭhavattaṃ pana vo vadāmi, ",
  "snp2.14:19.2": "yathākaro sāvako sādhu hoti, ",
  "snp2.14:19.3": "na h' eso labbhā sapariggahena ",
  "snp2.14:19.4": "phassetuṃ yo kevalo bhikkhudhammo. 394. ",
  "snp2.14:20.1": "Pāṇaṃ na hane, na ca ghātayeyya, ",
  "snp2.14:20.2": "na cānujaññā hanataṃ paresaṃ, -- ",
  "snp2.14:20.3": "sabbesu bhūtesu nidhāya daṇḍaṃ, ",
  "snp2.14:20.4": "ye thāvarā ye ca tasanti loke. 395. ",
  "snp2.14:21.1": "Tato adinnaṃ parivajjayeyya ",
  "snp2.14:21.2": "kiñci kvaci sāvako bujjhamāno, ",
  "snp2.14:21.3": "na hāraye, harataṃ nānujaññā: ",
  "snp2.14:21.4": "sabbaṃ adinnaṃ parivajjayeyya. 396. ",
  "snp2.14:22.1": "Abrahmacariyaṃ parivajjayeyya ",
  "snp2.14:22.2": "aṅgārakāsuṃ jalitaṃ va viññū, ",
  "snp2.14:22.3": "asambhuṇanto pana brahmacariyaṃ ",
  "snp2.14:22.4": "parassa dāraṃ nātikkameyya. 397. ",
  "snp2.14:23.1": "Sabhaggato vā parisaggato vā ",
  "snp2.14:23.2": "ekassa v' eko na musā bhaṇeyya, ",
  "snp2.14:23.3": "na bhāṇaye, bhaṇataṃ nānujaññā: ",
  "snp2.14:23.4": "sabbaṃ abhūtaṃ parivajjayeyya. 398. ",
  "snp2.14:24.1": "Majjañ ca pānaṃ na samācareyya, ",
  "snp2.14:24.2": "dhammaṃ imaṃ rocaye yo gahaṭṭho, ",
  "snp2.14:24.3": "na pāyaye, pipataṃ nānujaññā ",
  "snp2.14:24.4": "‘ummādanantaṃ' iti naṃ viditvā. 399. ",
  "snp2.14:25.1": "Madā hi pāpāni karonti bālā, ",
  "snp2.14:25.2": "kārenti c' aññe pi jane pamatte,| ",
  "snp2.14:25.3": "etaṃ apuññāyatanaṃ vivajjaye ",
  "snp2.14:25.4": "ummādanaṃ mohanaṃ bālakantaṃ. 400. ",
  "snp2.14:26.1": "Pāṇaṃ na hane, na cādinnam ādiye, ",
  "snp2.14:26.2": "musā na bhāse, na ca majjapo siyā, ",
  "snp2.14:26.3": "abrahmacariyā virameyya methunā, ",
  "snp2.14:26.4": "rattiṃ na bhuñjeyya vikālabhojanaṃ, 401. ",
  "snp2.14:27.1": "mālaṃ na dhāraye na ca gandham ācare, ",
  "snp2.14:27.2": "mañce chamāyaṃ va sayetha santhate, - ",
  "snp2.14:27.3": "etaṃ hi aṭṭhaṅgikam āh' uposathaṃ ",
  "snp2.14:27.4": "Buddhena dukkhantagunā pakāsitaṃ. 402. ",
  "snp2.14:28.1": "Tato ca pakkhass' upavass' uposathaṃ ",
  "snp2.14:28.2": "cātuddasiṃ pañcadasiñ ca aṭṭhamiṃ ",
  "snp2.14:28.3": "pāṭihāriyapakkhañ ca pasannamānaso ",
  "snp2.14:28.4": "aṭṭhaṅgupetaṃ susamattarūpaṃ. 403. ",
  "snp2.14:29.1": "Tato ca pāto upavutthuposatho ",
  "snp2.14:29.2": "annena pānena ca bhikkhusaṃghaṃ ",
  "snp2.14:29.3": "pasannacitto anumodamāno ",
  "snp2.14:29.4": "yathārahaṃ saṃvibhajetha viññū. 404. ",
  "snp2.14:30.1": "Dhammena mātāpitaro bhareyya ",
  "snp2.14:30.2": "payojaye dhammikaṃ so vaṇijjaṃ, ",
  "snp2.14:30.3": "etaṃ gihī vattayaṃ appamatto ",
  "snp2.14:30.4": "Sayampabhe nāma upeti deve\" ti ",
  "snp2.14:30.5": "DHAMMIKASUTTAṂ NIṬṬHITAṂ. Tassa vaggassa uddānaṃ : Ratanaṃ Āmagandhañ ca Hiriñ ca Maṅgaluttamaṃ Sūcilomo Dhammacariyā puna Brāhmaṇadhammikaṃ Nāvā-ca suttaṃ Kiṃsīlaṃ Uṭṭhānaṃ atha Rāhulo Kappo ca Paribbājo Dhammiko ca punāparaṃ, cuddas' etāni suttāni ",
  "snp2.14:30.6": "Cūḷavaggo ti ",
  "snp2.14:31.0": "",
  "snp2.14:31.1": "",
  "snp2.14:31.2": "",
  "snp2.14:31.3": "",
  "snp2.14:31.4": "",
  "snp2.14:32.1": "vuccati. 405. ",
  "snp2.14:32.2": "",
  "snp2.14:32.3": "",
  "snp2.14:32.4": ""
}
